  "question": {
    "text": "Which of the following ions is the strongest oxidizing agent? (Atomic Number of $\\mathrm{Ce}=58, \\mathrm{Eu}=63, \\mathrm{~Tb}=65, \\mathrm{Lu}=71$ )",
